00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:50.480
skin care but if you're used to more clinical&nbsp;
brands then it might be a bit of a change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:54.720
so overall i'm really impressed with this&nbsp;
